  "setting": "Alternate Cold War: the Soviets organise the western Slavs (Poles, Czechs and Slovaks) into one state, as the southern Slavs are in Yugoslavia. East Germany keeps most of the old German Empire's lands, including East and West Prussia and the Danzig corridor. Hungary and Romania have left the Warsaw Pact, which is the USSR, East Germany, Zapadoslavia and Yugoslavia. Line troops match Soviet rank and file; a small Gwardia corps and the Sokol airborne division are the elite. Equipment is Soviet export standard plus native Polish and Czech designs; no Soviet-only first-line kit except the Czech licence BVP-2 (1987+) and one Soviet-supplied BMD regiment.",
